    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to talk to but it doesn't change the reality. it feels so hollow. like i'm just going through the motions of a life i don't even belong to anymore. it's not even sadness at this point, it's just... nothingness. i'm just waiting for something to happen so i can stop feeling like this. it actually get better or do we just used to",
